# libvpx/dav1d/ffmpeg archives + headers. Upstream commits these; we build them
# from the jni/third_party submodules instead, so everything the packaging step
# of build_ffmpeg_libvpx_dav1d_android_ndk27_merged.sh writes is generated.
TMessagesProj/jni/ffmpeg/include/
TMessagesProj/jni/ffmpeg/arm64-v8a/
