TMessagesProj/jni/ffmpeg/x86/
TMessagesProj/jni/ffmpeg/x86_64/
TMessagesProj/jni/ffmpeg/.ndk-*
# tlottie: upstream commits the cargo-built archives, we build them from the
# jni/tlottie submodule with jni/tlottie_lib/build.sh.
TMessagesProj/jni/tlottie_lib/arm64-v8a/
TMessagesProj/jni/tlottie_lib/armeabi-v7a/
TMessagesProj/jni/tlottie_lib/x86/
TMessagesProj/jni/tlottie_lib/x86_64/
TMessagesProj/jni/tlottie_lib/build/
